# SYNTHETIC. Nothing arrived since the last sync pass: SELECT reports the same UIDNEXT the client
# synced to, so the watch idles as it always has.
S: * OK ready
C: a001 EXAMINE "INBOX"
S: * 4 EXISTS
S: * OK [UIDVALIDITY 42] valid
S: * OK [UIDNEXT 5] next
S: a001 OK [READ-ONLY] done
C: a002 IDLE
S: + idling
INTERRUPT
C: DONE
S: a002 OK IDLE terminated
DONE
